        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electron gun, for CRT tube production, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electron gun, for CRT tube production, at plant
Data about the composition of a CRT electron gun, based on literature and own estimations.;
UUID: 3c8a5468-6468-3c6d-9636-6cac45670fc1
This module is a rough estimation of the composition by including raw materials, infrastructure and transport efforts. Energy consumption, waste as well as all kind of emissions are not taken into account.
Location: Literature data are used to establish a global valuable dataset
Technology: estimation of the composition of a current CRT electron gun
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: own estimations 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c8a5468-6468-3c6d-9636-6cac45670fc1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
